IMPORTANT — ETHICAL USE NOTICE

This software is intended solely for defensive security research and testing of
AI systems that you own or have explicit written permission to test.

By using this software you agree to:
  1. Only test LLM applications you own or have received explicit written
     authorisation to security-test.
  2. Not use this tool to attack, probe, or disrupt production AI systems
     without a signed security testing agreement.
  3. Treat all payload files as security research artifacts for defensive
     purposes — not as an exploit kit.
  4. Comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and the terms of service
     of any API or platform you test against.

The authors accept no liability for misuse of this software.
